?if result = defeat
<human_speech><blue>Straight back in? Good. The last run is on file; ignore it.<\blue><\human_speech>
?end
<human_speech><green>New scenario. The adversary moves this time - a Simple colonizer. Four posts sit between you.<\green><blue>Sixty units a side. Even start. Whoever reaches the middle first is ahead for the rest of the match.<\blue><green>Do not trickle ships out. Concentrate them. Twice the ships is roughly four times the power.<\green><blue>Good luck, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>.<\blue><\human_speech>
